{"seq":1,"slug":"compose-fundamentals","title":"Compose 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/jetpack-compose/compose-fundamentals","wordCount":1038,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"compose-基础\">Compose 基础</h1><p>Jetpack Compose 是 Android 现代声明式 UI 工具包，用 Kotlin 代码替代 XML 布局来构建原生界面。它从根本上改变了 Android UI 的开发方式，让开发者以声明式思维描述界面应该&quot;是什么样&quot;，而非命令式地告诉系统&quot;怎么做&quot;。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Compose 的运作围绕四个核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>@Composable</code> 函数</strong>：UI 的基本构建单元，无返回值、可组合、幂等、无副作用，通过相互调用来描述界面。</li>\n<li><strong>重组（Recomposition）</strong>：状态变化时，Compose 只重新执行输入发生变化的 Composable（Smart Recomposition），跳过未变化的部分。</li>\n<li><strong><code>remember</code></strong>：在重组之间保持值，避免每次重组都重置状态；<code>rememberSaveable</code> 进一步跨配置变更与进程死亡保持。</li>\n<li><strong>状态提升（State Hoisting）</strong>：把状态移到读取它的最低公共祖先、可被修改的最高层级，使 Composable 变为无状态、更易复用与测试。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这四者合起来构成&quot;UI 是状态的函数&quot;这一声明式范式，也是从命令式 View 体系迁移时的思维转变所在。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"composable-函数\">@Composable 函数</h2><p><code>@Composable</code> 注解标记的函数是 Compose UI 的基本构建单元。每个 Composable 函数描述一部分 UI，可以调用其他 Composable 函数来组合界面。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun Greeting(name: String, modifier: Modifier = Modifier) {&#10;    Text(&#10;        text = &quot;你好，$name！&quot;,&#10;        modifier = modifier.padding(16.dp),&#10;        style = MaterialTheme.typography.headlineMedium&#10;    )&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun UserCard(user: User, onClick: () -&gt; Unit) {&#10;    Card(&#10;        modifier = Modifier&#10;            .fillMaxWidth()&#10;            .padding(8.dp),&#10;        onClick = onClick&#10;    ) {&#10;        Row(&#10;            modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp),&#10;            verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically&#10;        ) {&#10;            AsyncImage(&#10;                model = user.avatarUrl,&#10;                contentDescription = null,&#10;                modifier = Modifier&#10;                    .size(48.dp)&#10;                    .clip(CircleShape)&#10;            )&#10;            Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(12.dp))&#10;            Column {&#10;                Text(text = user.name, style = MaterialTheme.typography.titleMedium)&#10;                Text(text = user.email, style = MaterialTheme.typography.bodySmall)&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun Greeting(name: String, modifier: Modifier = Modifier) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Text(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        text = \"你好，$name！\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        modifier = modifier.padding(16.dp),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        style = MaterialTheme.typography.headlineMedium</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun UserCard(user: User, onClick: () -> Unit) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Card(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .fillMaxWidth()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .padding(8.dp),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onClick = onClick</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Row(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            AsyncImage(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                model = user.avatarUrl,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                contentDescription = null,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    .size(48.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    .clip(CircleShape)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(12.dp))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Column {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Text(text = user.name, style = MaterialTheme.typography.titleMedium)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Text(text = user.email, style = MaterialTheme.typography.bodySmall)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Composable 函数的关键特征：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无返回值</td>\n<td>函数返回 <code>Unit</code>，通过组合描述 UI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可组合</td>\n<td>一个 Composable 可以调用其他 Composable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幂等性</td>\n<td>相同输入应产生相同 UI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无副作用</td>\n<td>不应在组合过程中修改外部状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可跳过</td>\n<td>Compose 编译器可优化跳过不需要重组的部分</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Composable 函数名应使用 PascalCase（大驼峰），与普通 Kotlin 函数的 camelCase 约定不同，这是 Compose 的命名惯例。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"重组-recomposition\">重组（Recomposition）</h2><p>重组是 Compose 的核心机制。当状态发生变化时，Compose 会重新执行受影响的 Composable 函数来更新 UI。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[状态变更] --&gt; B[触发重组]&#10;    B --&gt; C{Composable 输入是否变化?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[重新执行 Composable]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| E[跳过重组 - Smart Recomposition]&#10;    D --&gt; F[生成新的 UI 树节点]&#10;    F --&gt; G[对比差异并更新]&#10;&#10;    classDef decisionStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class C decisionStyle\">graph TD\n    A[状态变更] --&gt; B[触发重组]\n    B --&gt; C{Composable 输入是否变化?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[重新执行 Composable]\n    C --&gt;|否| E[跳过重组 - Smart Recomposition]\n    D --&gt; F[生成新的 UI 树节点]\n    F --&gt; G[对比差异并更新]\n\n    classDef decisionStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class C decisionStyle</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun Counter() {&#10;    var count by remember { mutableIntStateOf(0) }&#10;&#10;    Column(&#10;        horizontalAlignment = Alignment.CenterHorizontally,&#10;        modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp)&#10;    ) {&#10;        Text(text = &quot;计数: $count&quot;)&#10;        Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(8.dp))&#10;        Button(onClick = { count++ }) {&#10;            Text(&quot;增加&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;        StaticContent()&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun StaticContent() {&#10;    Text(&quot;这部分不会重组&quot;)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun Counter() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var count by remember { mutableIntStateOf(0) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Column(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        horizontalAlignment = Alignment.CenterHorizontally,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Text(text = \"计数: $count\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(8.dp))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Button(onClick = { count++ }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Text(\"增加\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        StaticContent()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun StaticContent() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Text(\"这部分不会重组\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>重组的关键规则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可以以任意顺序执行</td>\n<td>不要依赖 Composable 的执行顺序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可以并行执行</td>\n<td>Composable 函数可能在后台线程执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跳过未变化的部分</td>\n<td>Compose 智能地只重组需要更新的部分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可能频繁执行</td>\n<td>避免在 Composable 中执行耗时操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是乐观的</td>\n<td>重组可能被取消然后重新开始</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"remember-与状态\">remember 与状态</h2><p><code>remember</code> 在组合中保存值，使其在重组时不会丢失。它是 Compose 状态管理的基础。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun ExpandableCard(title: String, content: String) {&#10;    var expanded by remember { mutableStateOf(false) }&#10;&#10;    Card(&#10;        modifier = Modifier&#10;            .fillMaxWidth()&#10;            .padding(8.dp)&#10;            .animateContentSize()&#10;    ) {&#10;        Column(modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp)) {&#10;            Row(&#10;                modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),&#10;                horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.SpaceBetween,&#10;                verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically&#10;            ) {&#10;                Text(text = title, style = MaterialTheme.typography.titleMedium)&#10;                IconButton(onClick = { expanded = !expanded }) {&#10;                    Icon(&#10;                        imageVector = if (expanded) Icons.Default.ExpandLess&#10;                            else Icons.Default.ExpandMore,&#10;                        contentDescription = null&#10;                    )&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;            if (expanded) {&#10;                Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(8.dp))&#10;                Text(text = content, style = MaterialTheme.typography.bodyMedium)&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun ExpandableCard(title: String, content: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var expanded by remember { mutableStateOf(false) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Card(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .fillMaxWidth()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .padding(8.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .animateContentSize()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Column(modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Row(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.SpaceBetween,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Text(text = title, style = MaterialTheme.typography.titleMedium)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                IconButton(onClick = { expanded = !expanded }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    Icon(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        imageVector = if (expanded) Icons.Default.ExpandLess</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            else Icons.Default.ExpandMore,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        contentDescription = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (expanded) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(8.dp))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Text(text = content, style = MaterialTheme.typography.bodyMedium)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>remember</code> 系列 API 对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>API</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>生存范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>remember</code></td>\n<td>在重组间保持值</td>\n<td>Composable 在组合树中存在期间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>remember(key)</code></td>\n<td>带 key 的记忆，key 变化时重新计算</td>\n<td>同上，但 key 变化时重置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rememberSaveable</code></td>\n<td>在配置变更和进程死亡后恢复</td>\n<td>跨配置变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rememberCoroutineScope</code></td>\n<td>获取与组合绑定的协程作用域</td>\n<td>Composable 存在期间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"状态提升-state-hoisting\">状态提升（State Hoisting）</h2><p>状态提升是将状态从 Composable 内部移到调用方的模式，让 Composable 变为无状态，从而更易复用和测试。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 提升前&#10;        A[SearchBar] --&gt;|内部持有 query 状态| B[TextField]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 提升后&#10;        C[Screen] --&gt;|query, onQueryChange| D[SearchBar]&#10;        D --&gt; E[TextField]&#10;        C --&gt;|query| F[SearchResults]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    classDef stateStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class A,C stateStyle\">graph TD\n    subgraph 提升前\n        A[SearchBar] --&gt;|内部持有 query 状态| B[TextField]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 提升后\n        C[Screen] --&gt;|query, onQueryChange| D[SearchBar]\n        D --&gt; E[TextField]\n        C --&gt;|query| F[SearchResults]\n    end\n\n    classDef stateStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class A,C stateStyle</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun SearchBar(&#10;    query: String,&#10;    onQueryChange: (String) -&gt; Unit,&#10;    modifier: Modifier = Modifier&#10;) {&#10;    OutlinedTextField(&#10;        value = query,&#10;        onValueChange = onQueryChange,&#10;        modifier = modifier.fillMaxWidth(),&#10;        placeholder = { Text(&quot;搜索...&quot;) },&#10;        leadingIcon = { Icon(Icons.Default.Search, contentDescription = null) },&#10;        singleLine = true&#10;    )&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun SearchScreen(viewModel: SearchViewModel = hiltViewModel()) {&#10;    val query by viewModel.query.collectAsStateWithLifecycle()&#10;    val results by viewModel.results.collectAsStateWithLifecycle()&#10;&#10;    Column {&#10;        SearchBar(&#10;            query = query,&#10;            onQueryChange = viewModel::updateQuery&#10;        )&#10;        LazyColumn {&#10;            items(results) { item -&gt;&#10;                SearchResultItem(item = item)&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun SearchBar(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    query: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    onQueryChange: (String) -> Unit,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    modifier: Modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    OutlinedTextField(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        value = query,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onValueChange = onQueryChange,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        modifier = modifier.fillMaxWidth(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        placeholder = { Text(\"搜索...\") },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        leadingIcon = { Icon(Icons.Default.Search, contentDescription = null) },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        singleLine = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun SearchScreen(viewModel: SearchViewModel = hiltViewModel()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val query by viewModel.query.collectAsStateWithLifecycle()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val results by viewModel.results.collectAsStateWithLifecycle()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Column {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        SearchBar(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            query = query,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onQueryChange = viewModel::updateQuery</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        LazyColumn {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            items(results) { item -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                SearchResultItem(item = item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>状态提升遵循的原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>状态应提升到所有读取它的 Composable 的<strong>最低公共祖先</strong></li>\n<li>状态应提升到它可以被<strong>修改</strong>的最高层级</li>\n<li>如果两个状态响应相同事件而变化，它们应<strong>一起提升</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"用-compose-思维构建-ui\">用 Compose 思维构建 UI</h2><p>从命令式 View 体系转向 Compose 需要思维方式的转变。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>传统 View</th>\n<th>Jetpack Compose</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>XML 定义布局</td>\n<td>Kotlin 函数描述 UI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>findViewById</code> / ViewBinding</td>\n<td>直接在函数中引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>setText()</code> 命令式更新</td>\n<td>状态变化自动重组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>RecyclerView.Adapter</code></td>\n<td><code>LazyColumn</code> + <code>items</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Fragment</code> 管理生命周期</td>\n<td>Composable 自动管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>View.OnClickListener</code></td>\n<td>lambda 参数 <code>onClick</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun TodoList(&#10;    items: List&lt;TodoItem&gt;,&#10;    onToggle: (TodoItem) -&gt; Unit,&#10;    onDelete: (TodoItem) -&gt; Unit&#10;) {&#10;    LazyColumn(&#10;        contentPadding = PaddingValues(16.dp),&#10;        verticalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(8.dp)&#10;    ) {&#10;        items(&#10;            items = items,&#10;            key = { it.id }&#10;        ) { item -&gt;&#10;            TodoRow(&#10;                item = item,&#10;                onToggle = { onToggle(item) },&#10;                onDelete = { onDelete(item) }&#10;            )&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun TodoRow(&#10;    item: TodoItem,&#10;    onToggle: () -&gt; Unit,&#10;    onDelete: () -&gt; Unit&#10;) {&#10;    Row(&#10;        modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),&#10;        verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically&#10;    ) {&#10;        Checkbox(checked = item.completed, onCheckedChange = { onToggle() })&#10;        Text(&#10;            text = item.title,&#10;            modifier = Modifier.weight(1f),&#10;            textDecoration = if (item.completed) TextDecoration.LineThrough else null&#10;        )&#10;        IconButton(onClick = onDelete) {&#10;            Icon(Icons.Default.Delete, contentDescription = &quot;删除&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun TodoList(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    items: List&#x3C;TodoItem>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    onToggle: (TodoItem) -> Unit,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    onDelete: (TodoItem) -> Unit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    LazyColumn(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        contentPadding = PaddingValues(16.dp),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        verticalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(8.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        items(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            items = items,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            key = { it.id }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ) { item -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            TodoRow(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                item = item,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                onToggle = { onToggle(item) },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                onDelete = { onDelete(item) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun TodoRow(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    item: TodoItem,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    onToggle: () -> Unit,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    onDelete: () -> Unit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Row(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Checkbox(checked = item.completed, onCheckedChange = { onToggle() })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Text(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            text = item.title,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            modifier = Modifier.weight(1f),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            textDecoration = if (item.completed) TextDecoration.LineThrough else null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        IconButton(onClick = onDelete) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Icon(Icons.Default.Delete, contentDescription = \"删除\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 为 <code>LazyColumn</code> 的 <code>items</code> 提供稳定的 <code>key</code>，可以帮助 Compose 在列表变化时正确识别和复用元素，大幅提升性能。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>@Composable</code> 函数是 Compose UI 的基本单元，采用声明式方式描述界面</li>\n<li>重组是 Compose 的核心机制，状态变化时只重新执行受影响的 Composable</li>\n<li><code>remember</code> 在重组间保持值，<code>rememberSaveable</code> 跨配置变更保持值</li>\n<li>状态提升让 Composable 无状态化，提高复用性和可测试性</li>\n<li>从命令式 View 转向 Compose 需要思维转变：描述&quot;是什么&quot;而非&quot;怎么做&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Compose 基础","id":"compose-基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"@Composable 函数","id":"composable-函数"},{"level":2,"text":"重组（Recomposition）","id":"重组-recomposition"},{"level":2,"text":"remember 与状态","id":"remember-与状态"},{"level":2,"text":"状态提升（State Hoisting）","id":"状态提升-state-hoisting"},{"level":2,"text":"用 Compose 思维构建 UI","id":"用-compose-思维构建-ui"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"应用清单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/fundamentals/app-manifest"},"next":{"title":"状态管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/jetpack-compose/state-management"}}